<!--
    The themed-icon layer, for the Android 13 setting that repaints every icon in
    the launcher's own colours.

    The same two paths as the foreground, deliberately in a separate file rather
    than a reference to it: the system tints this one itself, so its ink has to be
    the placeholder black that tinting expects, not the taupe that sits on the
    cream background.

    That leaves two copies of the geometry, which is exactly the arrangement that
    goes wrong quietly — the foreground changes, this does not, and the first sign
    is a themed launcher showing last month's drawing. LauncherIconTest compares
    the two files path for path, so it cannot.
-->
